# The repository stores text files with LF line endings, and Prettier
# (`endOfLine: "lf"`) and .editorconfig both expect LF. Without this file,
# Windows clones with core.autocrlf=true check files out as CRLF and
# `pnpm format:check` reports every file. Check text out as LF everywhere;
# git detects binary files (images, fonts, PDFs, archives) automatically.
* text=auto eol=lf
